--- !u!114 &299427042
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 299427041}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8e64fc24e14ec55469c5f57ff935e13d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueList:
  - label: 0
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a44a5adf7ba03924cb55b8f451d3f683, type: 3}
    textContent: 'Welcome to V-lock assembly. Here you will be learning how to assemble
      a simple v-lock in a step by step tutorial. Please press the start button to
      go to the main menu. '
    specificDisplay: {fileID: 0}
  - label: 1
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a6799d6ae955443478586e2a3ace3c57, type: 3}
    textContent: 'This is a V-lock assembly. It consists of eight components: Tools,
      Housing, Big Screw, Small Screw, V-lock Plate, Plunger, Helical Spring, and
      Cover. Your task is to assemble these parts by following a step-by-step procedure.
      Please note that steps must be completed in sequence. You can access the handy
      menu at any time by opening your palm. To begin, please click the back button
      and proceed with the tasks. '
    specificDisplay: {fileID: 1389406502}
  - label: 2
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b52ee4b706c7be043a6a817bd6768dfd, type: 3}
    textContent: "Task-1. Setting up V-lock Plate.\r\nHere you will be putting a
      Big screw in the screw hole of the V-Lock plate. \r\nPlease verify if you have
      the necessary parts (V-lock plate and Big Screw) with you. \r\nonce you have
      verified the parts, please press done on the main screen. "
    specificDisplay: {fileID: 40671283}
  - label: 3
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5f15db30b99e7af4b97a93527956c314, type: 3}
    textContent: Now, screw the Big screw in the threaded hole of the V-lock as shown
      in the assembly tab. Once you are done, please press the done button and proceed
      with the next task.
    specificDisplay: {fileID: 40671283}
  - label: 4
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 06eee4e1379be5c4ca6a74d6689b5916, type: 3}
    textContent: "Task-2. Setting up the lock.\r\nHere you will be inserting the
      plunger and spring in the housing which will be the lock of the whole mechanism.
      \r\nPlease verify if you have the necessary parts (Housing, helical spring
      and Plunger) with you. \r\nonce you have verified the parts, please press done
      on the main screen. "
    specificDisplay: {fileID: 1601029296}
  - label: 5
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bfca43a8a306e1348aa91c5901d59fc3, type: 3}
    textContent: 'Now, following the reference in the assembly tab, put the spring
      and the plunger in the housing. Once you''re done, press the back button and
      proceed with the next task. '
    specificDisplay: {fileID: 1601029296}
  - label: 6
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 27edfe04f2e7c2b458dde94db7e533c1, type: 3}
    textContent: "Task-3. Cover the lock.\r\nHere you will be putting the cover on
      the housing with 4 small screws to secure the lock. \r\nPlease verify if you
      have the necessary parts (Housing with lock from task-2, 4 Small Screws, and
      Cover) with you. \r\nonce you have verified the parts, please press done on
      the main screen. "
    specificDisplay: {fileID: 383311111}
  - label: 7
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5da6c9538a4530c489ef27dd8596cae6, type: 3}
    textContent: 'Now, following the reference in the assembly tab, put the cover
      on the housing and screw all 4 small screws in the threaded holes. Once you''re
      done, press the back button and proceed with the next task. '
    specificDisplay: {fileID: 383311111}
  - label: 8
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e87a310027d6cc641960338517653dc4, type: 3}
    textContent: "Task-4. Setting up the housing.\r\nHere you will be putting 2 Big
      Screws to the housing which will be used to attached to other equipments. \r\nPlease
      verify if you have the necessary parts (Housing with lock and cover from task-3
      and 2 Big Screws) with you. \r\nOnce you have verified the parts, please press
      done on the main screen. "
    specificDisplay: {fileID: 67266876}
  - label: 9
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e87a310027d6cc641960338517653dc4, type: 3}
    textContent: "Task-4. Setting up the housing.\r\nHere you will be putting 2 Big
      Screws to the housing which will be used to attached to other equipments. \r\nPlease
      verify if you have the necessary parts (Housing with lock and cover from task-3
      and 2 Big Screws) with you. \r\nOnce you have verified the parts, please press
      done on the main screen. "
    specificDisplay: {fileID: 67266876}
  - label: 10
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 38849779403941043b440b49157a4d62, type: 3}
    textContent: 'Now, following the reference in the assembly tab, Screw the Big
      screws in the threaded holes of the housing. Once you''re done, press the back
      button and proceed with the next task. '
    specificDisplay: {fileID: 67266876}
  - label: 11
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 605e748680c463840b556f4f77964ed4, type: 3}
    textContent: "Task-5: Final Assembly. \r\nplacing the v-lock to the assembled
      housing. \r\nplease verify if you have necessary parts(assembled housing from
      task-4 and assembled v-lock plate) and press done.  "
    specificDisplay: {fileID: 1330061342}
  - label: 12
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e4cca7dfa5b7f9e4a9cf1226cc243b2f, type: 3}
    textContent: Slide in the V-lock plate to the housing as shown in the sassemble
      tab.Then press done when completed.
    specificDisplay: {fileID: 1330061342}
  playOnStart: 1
  startIndex: 0
  audioSource: {fileID: 299427044}
  globalDisplayTMP: {fileID: 1058484860}
  wordSpeed: 0.3
